  "nodes": [
    {"id":"1029384756abcdef","type":"file","x":0,"y":0,"width":380,"height":260,"file":"System/Knowledge_Workflow.md"},
    {"id":"2130495867bcdefa","type":"text","x":500,"y":-300,"width":300,"height":180,"text":"## 1. 输入与判断\n围绕真实问题收集材料，用世界观 / 方法论标准筛选。"},
    {"id":"3241506978cdefab","type":"text","x":500,"y":-60,"width":300,"height":180,"text":"## 2. 提炼模型\n拆解 → 淘金 → 理解 → 判断 → 启发。"},
    {"id":"4352617089defabc","type":"text","x":500,"y":180,"width":300,"height":180,"text":"## 3. 原子化存储\n一张卡一个可复用主张；保留 Properties、来源和个人思考。"},
    {"id":"5463728190efabcd","type":"text","x":500,"y":420,"width":300,"height":180,"text":"## 4. 连接与组装\n用因果、层次、类比、对比、演化、依赖连接模型。"},
    {"id":"6574839201fabcde","type":"file","x":950,"y":80,"width":390,"height":260,"file":"03_Knowledge/01_Topics/Knowledge_System_Building.md"},
    {"id":"7685940312abcdef","type":"file","x":950,"y":420,"width":390,"height":260,"file":"03_Knowledge/00_Cards/README.md"}
